  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">##Arsenic decontamination through integrated arsenic management in the Northern regions of Thailand#</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: to demonstrate arsenic decontamination in Kok River by establishing a monitoring system and arsenic removal scheme through integrated arsenic management in Chiang Mai or Chiang Rai, Thailand.  Outcome: Arsenic decontamination is demonstrated by establishing an integrated arsenic management plan, a monitoring system for arsenic and a sustainable, cost-effective arsenic removal strategy.  Community farmers benefit from improved access to clean water, fertilizers, and alternative income opportunities that help offset losses caused by arsenic contamination.</narrative>
  </description>
